  "prefLabel": "Plu 212.09 Appeal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 212.09 Appeal. Pursuant to RSA 155-A:11-a any party aggrieved by a final decision or order of the board shall appeal to the building code review board established by RSA 155-A:10.\n\nSource. #8464, eff 10-28-05",
